<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <actionCalls>
        <name>SendProviderEmail</name>
        <label>Action: Send Email to Provider</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>395</locationY>
        <actionName>emailSimple</actionName>
        <actionType>emailSimple</actionType>
        <connector><targetReference>CreateNotificationTask</targetReference></connector>
        <flowTransactionModel>CurrentTransaction</flowTransactionModel>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>emailAddresses</name>
            <value><elementReference>GetProviderContact.Email</elementReference></value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>emailSubject</name>
            <value><elementReference>providerEmailSubject</elementReference></value>
        </inputParameters>
        <inputParameters>
            <name>emailBody</name>
            <value><elementReference>providerEmailBody</elementReference></value>
        </inputParameters>
        <nameSegment>emailSimple</nameSegment>
    </actionCalls>
    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <decisions>
        <name>NoticeAlreadySent</name>
        <label>Decision: Notice Already Sent?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>359</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Notice Exists</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>NoNoticeYet</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetExistingNoticeTask</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>SendProviderEmail</targetReference></connector>
            <label>No Notice Yet</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>ProviderHasEmail</name>
        <label>Decision: Provider Has Email?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>287</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No Email</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>EmailAvailable</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetProviderContact</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>GetProviderContact.Email</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>GetExistingNoticeTask</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Email Available</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>RouteAppraisalChange</name>
        <label>Decision: Accepted Now?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>119</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Nothing Relevant</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>AcceptedNow</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>Aceptado</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record__Prior.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><stringValue>Aceptado</stringValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>GetAcceptedAppraisal</targetReference></connector>
            <label>Accepted Now</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>RouteProviderNotice</name>
        <label>Decision: External Provider Assigned?</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>149</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No Provider / No Reference</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>ProviderAssigned</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.AppraisedById</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>false</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>appraiserIsContact</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector><targetReference>GetProviderContact</targetReference></connector>
            <label>External Provider Assigned</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>v2 (fix 10/08). All countries. After-save handler del Appraisal (trade-in de usados). FIX ESTRUCTURAL: la pierna de notificación al proveedor externo se movió a un CAMINO ASINCRÓNICO (Run Asynchronously) — un fallo de email (p.ej. Deliverability "System Email Only" en sandbox) o de lookup YA NO BLOQUEA el guardado del avalúo (causa del "unhandled fault" en Create Appraisal Record). Guardas nuevas: detección de proveedor externo por PREFIJO 003 del AppraisedById (fórmula — nunca consulta Contact con Id de User, que era la otra falla posible), ReferenceRecordId requerido en ambas ramas, y null-check del contacto. Rama síncrona conservada: al aceptar, estampa FinalAppraisalValue en TradeInValue__c de la Opportunity. Dedupe del aviso por task de trazabilidad (sin cambios).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>appraiserIsContact</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>LEFT({!$Record.AppraisedById}, 3) = '003'</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Appraisal After Handler {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Appraisal After Handler</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value><stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue></value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordCreates>
        <name>CreateNotificationTask</name>
        <label>Create Notification Log Task</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>503</locationY>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Description</field>
            <value><stringValue>Notificación automática enviada al proveedor externo con la intención del cliente de realizar el avalúo del vehículo usado. Trazabilidad del criterio de proveedor externo de la historia de avalúo.</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>OwnerId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.OwnerId</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <value><stringValue>Aviso enviado al proveedor externo del avalúo</stringValue></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Task</object>
    </recordCreates>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetAcceptedAppraisal</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Accepted Appraisal</label>
        <locationX>396</locationX><locationY>179</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>UpdateOpportunityTradeIn</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Appraisal</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetExistingNoticeTask</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Existing Notice</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>323</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>NoticeAlreadySent</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>WhatId</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Subject</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><stringValue>Aviso enviado al proveedor externo del avalúo</stringValue></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Task</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>GetProviderContact</name>
        <label>Get Records: Get Provider Contact</label>
        <locationX>176</locationX><locationY>179</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector><targetReference>ProviderHasEmail</targetReference></connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.AppraisedById</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>Contact</object>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordUpdates>
        <name>UpdateOpportunityTradeIn</name>
        <label>Set Trade-In Value on Opportunity</label>
        <locationX>396</locationX><locationY>239</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value><elementReference>$Record.ReferenceRecordId</elementReference></value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>TradeInValue__c</field>
            <value><elementReference>GetAcceptedAppraisal.FinalAppraisalValue</elementReference></value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Opportunity</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>50</locationX><locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector><targetReference>RouteAppraisalChange</targetReference></connector>
        <object>Appraisal</object>
        <recordTriggerType>CreateAndUpdate</recordTriggerType>
        <scheduledPaths>
            <name>AsyncProviderNotice</name>
            <label>Notificación al proveedor (async)</label>
            <connector><targetReference>RouteProviderNotice</targetReference></connector>
            <pathType>AsyncAfterCommit</pathType>
        </scheduledPaths>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Draft</status>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>providerEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Estimado proveedor,

Le informamos que un cliente tiene la intención de realizar el avalúo de su vehículo usado como parte de una negociación de compra.

Vigencia de la solicitud: {!$Record.ValidityEndDate}

Por favor coordine la cita con la sucursal correspondiente.

[TEXTO PROVISORIO — reemplazar con la redacción oficial del negocio al llegar el insumo]

GrupoQ</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>providerEmailSubject</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Solicitud de avalúo de vehículo usado — GrupoQ</text>
    </textTemplates>
</Flow>
